recommend check-in (Keaton) the deadlock stands and its cure is a seat -- raise this page's bound, split the OPEN flag into live-defect and booked-remainder so reds_fold.sh can fold the second, or sanction the single-row shelf birth; only the split reaches the cause. Five roster reds also stand, two of them Pond on a macOS bench.
